* NMOS and PMOS transistor models
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS

* Voltage Source
Vsig 2 7 DC 0

* Resistor
Rsig 2 4 R_sig_value

* Current Sources
I1 6 3 DC current_value
I2 3 3 DC current_value

* Transistors
Q1 3 4 3 3 NMOS
Q2 3 5 8 8 PMOS

* Voltage Output Node
Vo 5 6

* Ground
VSS 8 0

.end